        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nope, not a playtester. &nbsp;I don't like seeing how the cards <em>might</em> be, I want to see how they <em>are, </em>in my hands, playing with them.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>And that's the exact reason why I didn't opt for playtesting either.</p>",
