        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-25T19:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Playtesters got pdfs the final card sheets this time, including the images (which made certain cards make soooo much more sense). One last chance to spot errors and corrections. This was right at the end of the playtest. Most of the time, we had text only PDFs to work with.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But yes, printign the whole thing in colour is expensive. Wore out my printer.</p>",
